  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Turkey Noodle Casserole",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s delicious turkey noodle casserole recipe includes garam masala, spicy cheese, and bell peppers for a rich, creamy, and perfectly spiced meal.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-05-07T14:16:10-04:00",
